                                                "sense_id": "b68eee2f-bb07-30a4-bc4a-ca9d6d7f38a9",
                                                "text": "If the strippers learn that there is a bachelor party, they will often call the groom onstage and publicly embarrass him. They may tie him up, whip him, tease him, give him a wedgie, cover him in whipped cream, beat his ass with a belt, put a dog collar on him, walk him around the stage like a dog, and/or humiliate him with whatever objects are at their disposal."
